  "content": {
    "prompt": "Write Python code that sets a to 10 and b to 3. If a minus b is greater than 5, swap the values of a and b using a variable named temp (set temp to a, then set a to b, then set b to temp). Otherwise, add 1 to a and add 1 to b. Print a and then print b.",
    "source_code": "a = 10\nb = 3\nif a - b > 5:\n    temp = a\n    a = b\n    b = temp\nelse:\n    a = a + 1\n    b = b + 1\nprint(a)\nprint(b)\n"
  },
